WEBVTT

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:32.976
that I decided I could pursue
doing more of these things.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:36.432
The next one is I froze myself
in a block of ice

00:00:36.456 --> 00:00:38.976
for three days and three nights
in New York City.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:42.697
That one was way more difficult
than I had expected.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:46.976
The one after that, I stood
on top of a hundred-foot pillar

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:48.976
for 36 hours.

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:51.499
I began to hallucinate so hard

00:00:51.523 --> 00:00:55.226
that the buildings that were behind me
started to look like big animal heads.

00:00:56.202 --> 00:00:57.976
So, next I went to London.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:01.976
In London I lived
in a glass box for 44 days